  "source_meaning": {
    "scene_field": "Adds explicit finite declared damping continuation through native ReplaceModes(false); unchanged constructor/M1/clock/form/shape/nine ordered mode sources. Its material-policy timing disclosure now states resident-mode continuation.",
    "host": "Routes set-damping only to provider-composed Scene owner and includes current event/influence in determinant ACK; supplied owner refuses.",
    "adapter": "Recognises set-damping as a changing native mode-generation operation and accepts the explicit operation; three copied adapter files remain native-owner copies, separately qualified by current provenance.",
    "tests": "Real-worker native tests predict matching EventIdentity profile/M2/M3 generation successor before admission, exact zero-elapsed amplitude/shape/clock/form invariance, nine complex decays and strict invalid/supplied refusal. Test source qualification does not assert execution."
  },
