  "required_execution": [
    "Build all five actual current QL companions with the canonical source installer and qualify exact output/toolchain/process custody.",
    "QL_FIELD_WORKER=<actual built worker> cargo test --locked -p ql-mef --test scene_instrument -- --ignored --test-threads=1",
    "Run unchanged full production whole-world assertions and joined D30 damping/Save/reopen/Return/new-process gates with this reviewed current expectation.",
    "Run actual current source-manifest negatives; reject original Ec-only template against QL47 and substituted/missing succession consumer source custody.",
    "Managed Mac installed replay, audio/hearing and human Recognition remain separately pending."
